<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Waves 1-2: authentication and profile.

    Split into a per-wave file rather than appended to strings.xml. Android
    merges every values/*.xml at build time, so the split costs nothing and it
    removes a permanent merge-conflict hotspot in a repo where several sessions
    edit concurrently. It also makes translation and review chunkable.

    Translations follow tools/i18n/glossary.md. Read it before adding to this
    file — the pinned terms must not drift between waves.
-->
